@startuml communication_lifecycle
!theme cyborg
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
skinparam state {
 FontColor #0b1018
}
title L2_COMMUNICATION lifecycle: from Wi-Fi join to delivery after Stop
hide empty description
state "Wi-Fi join\nboot join, link recovery or setup page" as Join
state "<color:#e6edf7>Idle network work (L2_CONTROL lease)</color>" as Idle #111826 {
 state "Idle check\nwhat is due?" as Check
 state "Connection preparation\none setup = SNTP exchange, DNS, TCP, TLS 1.3, verification\none deadline per setup" as Preparation
 state "Registration\nconditional Device create, validate, save record\none deadline per attempt" as Registration
 state "Prepared\nverified connection retained as reuse candidate\nregistration ready (record saved)" as Prepared
}
state "Listening (L2_CONTROL)\nno network work: no request, no setup, no SNTP\nstation association retained\nverified TLS connection retained dormant" as Listening
state "Finalizing (L2_CONTROL)\nresult frozen; no network work yet" as Finalizing
state "Delivery\nstarts when L2_CONTROL submits the finalized job\none deadline from Stop\nreuse an eligible retained connection, else new setup" as Delivery
[*] --> Join
Join -down-> Check : station address
Check --> Preparation : transport unverified,\nserver profile valid, retry gap elapsed
Check --> Registration : verified, no saved\nregistration for this server, retry gap elapsed
Check --> Prepared : verified and registered
Preparation --> Check : failed setup: server-connection fault,\nretried after a gap
Preparation --> Registration : verified; no saved\nregistration for this server
Preparation --> Prepared : verified; saved\nregistration matches
Registration --> Prepared : record committed
Registration --> Check : failed attempt: retried after a growing gap;\nattempts exhausted: unavailable until restart
Idle -down-> Listening : Start: pending services stopped,\nrelease acknowledged
Join --> Listening : Start: join cancelled
Listening -up-> Check : Stop before the minimum session length\nor no result: nothing sent
Listening -down-> Finalizing : Stop that enters finalization
Finalizing -up-> Check : no job: Wi-Fi unconfigured\nor delivery-not-possible fault
Finalizing -down-> Delivery : finalized job submitted
Delivery -up-> Check : job ends: receipt, delivery fault or\nserver-connection fault (no clock)
Delivery -up-> Listening : Start cancels the job: delivery fault, or\nserver-connection fault (no clock); result lost
@enduml
